---
// Copy: specs/03-blanqueamiento-hero-intro-destacada.md § Source of the content — the
// maintainer's short version of the intro in docs/brief/textos-blanqueamiento.md:5 (pending the
// client's confirmation, see client-gaps.md). One plain <p>: not a <blockquote> (it quotes no one)
// and no heading of its own (the section is labelled with aria-label instead).
// Design: an editorial pull-quote right below the hero — large Cormorant on ivory, centered,
// framed by a decorative opening quote mark and a short turquoise rule (both aria-hidden, not
// part of the text). Visible at every breakpoint.
// Behind the text sits the tooth logo as a decorative background (aria-hidden, low opacity). The
// logo is drawn in and the quote mark, paragraph and rule fade up once on scroll
// (src/utils/scripts/animations/blanqueamiento-dental/intro.ts).
// The doctor's name comes from AUTHORS in src/config/authors.ts (it stores it without "Dra.").
import { AUTHORS } from "@/config/authors";
import ToothLogo from "@/assets/icons/tooth-logo.svg";

const author = AUTHORS[0];
---

<section aria-label="Introducción al blanqueamiento dental" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ivory">
  <ToothLogo
    data-intro-logo
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -z-10 size-96 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-25 select-none lg:size-128"
  />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 xl:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center text-center">
      <span
        data-intro-item
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="font-cormorant text-7xl leading-none text-turquoise-dark select-none sm:text-8xl"
        >&ldquo;</span
      >

      <p
        data-intro-item
        class="-mt-4 font-cormorant text-2xl leading-snug font-medium text-pretty text-charcoal sm:-mt-6 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl"
      >
        El blanqueamiento o aclaramiento dental es un procedimiento estético que aclara el tono de
        tus dientes naturales y reduce pigmentaciones. En el consultorio de la Dra. {author.name},
        realizamos el procedimiento con un protocolo planificado, supervisión profesional y un
        ambiente diseñado para tu tranquilidad.
      </p>

      <span data-intro-item aria-hidden="true" class="mt-8 h-px w-16 bg-turquoise-dark sm:mt-10"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import "@/utils/scripts/animations/blanqueamiento-dental/intro";
</script>
